  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Catalysing Implementation of a Strategic Action Programme for the Sustainable Management of Shared Living Marine Resources in the Humboldt Current System (HCS)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="4">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Note: Disbursement data provided is cumulative and covers disbursement made by the project Agency.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To facilitate ecosystem-based fisheries management (EBFM) and ecosystem restoration in the Humboldt current system for the sustainable and resilient delivery of goods and services from shared living marine resources, in accordance with the Strategic Action Programme (SAP) endorsed by Chile and Peru.</narrative>
